Opalro is closed source. The user agreement that comes with each build of
Opalro, USER-AGREEMENT.md, is what lets a person use it. Nobody may copy,
change, pass on or take apart Opalro, or any part of it, except as that
agreement allows.

Opalro is built with code that other people wrote. That code stays under
its own licenses, listed in the notices that come with each build:
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES-RUST.html.
